    <div class="frame wide reveal"><img src="/images/sukiyaki.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"/></div>
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">For every guest</span>
      <h2 class="h-en" data-i18n="hal.h">Nothing you<br/>have to ask about.</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <p class="p" style="margin-top:26px;" data-i18n="hal.p1">No pork, no lard, no alcohol — not in the marinades, not in the sauces, not in the dessert. Mirin and cooking sake are replaced throughout.</p>
